<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HOS" style="id">HOZ - Bible en mashi du Congo</book>
  <para style="toc3">Hoz</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hozeya</para>
  <para style="toc1">HOZEYA, HOSHEYA</para>
  <para style="h">Hozeya</para>
  <para style="mt1">HOZEYA, HOSHEYA</para>
  <para style="imt1">Enshokolezi</para>
  <para style="ip">Hozeya aburhiragwa omu cihugo c’omwâmi w’emwênè (Israheli). Arhangiraga okuyigîriza amango ga Mwâmi Yerobwâmi wa kabirhi (783-743) embere ly’okuburhwa kwa Kristu, amango gonênè Omulêbi Amosi ajàga ayigîriza. Hozeya agendêrera okuyigîriza amango g’abâmi balondaga Yerobwâmi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hozeya ayanka Cameri nka mukâge anamuzigira bwenêne. Cikwône oyo mukazi amugayîsa erhi kulama kubî kwâge kurhuma. Okwo kurharhumaga Hozeya amugayaguza, agendêrera okumuzigira. Enyuma lya myâka minji, mukâge acîrheganya okugaluka emwa Hozeya. Hozeya amuyankirira n’omurhima gw’obuzigire.</para>
  <para style="ip">Akalamo k’omulêbi Hozeya lubà lwîganyo lw’okuyumvikana kwa Nnâmahanga na Israheli. Olwo lwîganyo luyêrekîne oku Nnâmahanga azigiraga olubaga lwâge lwîshogwa. Olwo lubaga lwamugayisa; cikwône Nnâmahanga arhalekaga okuluzigira ensiku zoshi; aluhana lyo alugulula omu bwôrhere bwinjà analugalulira obushagaluke bw’obuzigire burhanzi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hozeya akalihire kulusha abarhegesi bw’olubaga, abâmi n’abadâhwa bakulu. Okuharâmya ensanamu kurhenga muli ago mabî goshi. Aka Amosi, Hozeya agayaguza bwenêne obulyâlya n’okulibuza abantu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Abandi balêbi, nka Yehezekiyeli na Yeremiyahu bakulikira Hozeya omu kumanyîsa kurhi Nnâmahanga n’olubaga lwâge lw’e Israheli balagananaga. Endagâno Mpyâhya n’Abakristu barhanzi bashimbire olwo lwîganyo omu kuyumvikana kwa Kristu n’Ekleziya yâge.</para>
  <para style="iot">EBIRIMWO</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Obuhya bwa Hozeya kwo kuderha kurhi: cigabi: <char style="ior"><ref loc="HOS 1:1-3:5">1, 1—3, 5</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">2. Ecâha n’obuhane bwa Israheli: cigabi <char style="ior"><ref loc="HOS 4:1-13:15">4, 1—13, 15</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">3. Israheli agalukira Nyamuzinda, Nyamuzinda amuyankirira kandi: cigabi <char style="ior"><ref loc="HOS 14:1-10">14, 1-10</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HOS 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Izîno ly’ecitabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 1:1"/>Akanwa Nyakasane abwîraga Hozeya, mugala wa Beeri, oku ngoma ya Yoziyasi, ya Yotamu, ya Akazi n’eya Ezekiyasi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Enfarasè n’ecigereki byabahingwîre aga mazîno: <char style="tl">עֻזִּיָּ֥ה</char> UZIYAH; <char style="tl">יֹותָ֛ם</char> YOTAM; <char style="tl">אָחָ֥ז</char> AHAZ; YEHIZKIYAHU <char style="tl">יְחִזְקִיָּ֖ה</char></char></note>, bâmi b’e Yûda, n’oku ngoma ya Yerobwâmi, mugala wa Yowash, mwâmi w’Israheli.<verse eid="HOS 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="ms1">I. Obuhya bwa Hozeya n’ihwe lyâbwô</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 1:2"/>Omurhondêro gw’akanwa ka Nyakasane, omu kanwa ka Hozeya. Nyakasane abwîra Hozeya, erhi: «Genda, yanka omukazi w’embaraga n’abâna b’embaraga, bulya ecihugo cikola ca bya nsbonyi byône byône, caleka Nyamuzinda». <verse eid="HOS 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 1:3"/>Anacigenda obwo, ayanka Gomeri, mwâli wa Diblayimu, anacibà izîmi, aburha mugala. <verse eid="HOS 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 1:4"/>Nyamuzinda amubwîra, erhi: «Yirika-ye izîno lya Yizreeli, bulya hindi hitya hyône nahana enyumpa ya Yehu kwa gulya mukò bàbulagaga abà Yizreeli, na ntyo mperêrekeze obwâmi bw’enyumpa y’Israheli. <verse eid="HOS 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 1:5"/>“Olwo lusiku nâvunira omuherho gw’Israheli omu lwa Yizreeli”». <verse eid="HOS 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 1:6"/>Nyamukazi arhôla kandi izîmi, aburba mwâli. Nyamuzinda amubwîra, erhi, «Yirika-ye izîno lya Bashombe, bulya nkola nashomba enyumpa y’Israheli ntà kuciyibabalira.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bashombe: kwo kuderha oyu barhabêre bwonjo.</char></note> <verse eid="HOS 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 1:7"/>Ci nâbabalira enyumpa ya Yûda yoki, nnambacize muli Nyakasane, Nyamuzinda wâbo. Arhali muherho erhi ngôrho, erhi bîrha, erhi biterusi, erhi banyakulwîra oku biterusi bo nâbacizamwo.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ebyo binwa eri nyûshûlo y’abashimbûlizi ba Hozeya emunda bâli lubungo enyuma ly’okuhimwa kwa Samâriya.</char></note> <verse eid="HOS 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 1:8"/>Bashombe ànena amonka, nnina arhôla erindi izîmi, aburha murhabana. <verse eid="HOS 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 1:9"/>Nyamuzinda aderha, erhi: «Yirika-ye Lurhali-Lubaga-Lwâni, bulya murhali lubaga lwâni nâni ntali Nyamuzinda winyu.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Oku ago mazîno ganali asharhu gayerekine obukunizi bwa Nyamuzinda. Lêro obwonjo bwâge bwamahwa.</char></note><verse eid="HOS 1:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HOS 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Omu nsiku zâyisha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 2:1"/>Bene Israheli bâluga nka mushenyi gw’omunyanja, gwo gurhaganjwa gu­rhanagerwa. Ahâli h’okucikaderhwa: «Murhali-Lubaga-Lwâni», bâkaziderhwa Bene-Nyamuzinda Ozîne. <verse eid="HOS 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 2:2"/>Abâna ba Yûda n’ab’Israheli balungana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Olwo lusiku abâna ba Yûda n’ab’Israheli bahimana bashenshagane ecihugo na ntyo barhenge omu bujà.</char></note>, bâbà na mwâmi muguma, bânagandâza kurhaluka olubibi lw’ecihugo câbo bulya lwâbà luhamu olusiku lwa Yizreeli. <verse eid="HOS 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 2:3"/>Bwiragi bene winyu, erhi: «Lubaga lwâni», na bâli binyu, erhi: «Musîmwa»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lêro gakola mazîno minjà garhaciri nka agali muli 1, 6 na 1, 9.</char></note>.<verse eid="HOS 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obuhane n’obucîyunjuze bw’ishanja oku bubaraga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 2:4"/>Muhêke nyoko lubanja mumusambîse<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muhêke nyoko lubanja mumusambîse: emwa Abalêbi, okuhêkana lubanja bwàli bwôrhere: <char style="xt"><ref loc="HOS 4:1">4, 1</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 3:13">Iz 3, 13</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 6:1">Mik 6, 1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 2:9">Yer 2, 9</ref></char>. Aha, Nyamuzinda ye ohêrhe olubaga lwâge lulalahi lubà­njà.</char></note>. Bulya arhaciri mukânie, nâni ntaciri ibà. Aleke obubaraga bwâge, arhenze obugonyi omu cifuba câge. <verse eid="HOS 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 2:5"/>Akabà nanga namugendêsa bushugunu, mmujire nk’olusiku àburhagwa, nâmushushîsa obwerûle, namujira nk’idaho lyûmu, mmuyirhe n’enyôrha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omu bihugo by’ebushoshôkero bw’izûba erhi bahanaga omukazi banamuleka bushugunu: <char style="xt"><ref loc="EZK 16:37-39">Eze 16, 37-39</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 47:2-3">Iz 47, 2-3</ref>; <ref loc="JER 13:22">Yer 13, 22</ref>; <ref loc="NAM 3:5">Nah 3, 5</ref>; <ref loc="REV 17:10">Maf 17, 10</ref></char>. 2. 7: Oyo mukazi ashushanyîbwe n’ecihugo c’Israheli. Obuhirhi bwa Kanâni bwarhumaga Israheli ahirima omu câha (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HOS 10:1">10, 1</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 13:6">13, 6</ref></char>) bwâhirigirha: <char style="xt"><ref loc="HOS 4:3">4, 3</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 5:7">5, 7</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 13:15">13, 15</ref></char>.</char></note>. <verse eid="HOS 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 2:6"/>N’abâna bâge ntacibalonza bulya bali ba bubaraga. <verse eid="HOS 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 2:7"/>Nêci, nnina yàbîre mbaraga, owababurhaga àcîhemwîre; aderha, erhi: «Nâkulikira abalume bâni, bo bampà omugati n’amîshi, emishangi n’emipira, amavurha n’ecinyôbwa.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abalume bâni, bo banyamuzinda bw’obunywesi b’e Kanâni.</char></note> <verse eid="HOS 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 2:8"/>Co cirhumire nkola nafuka enjira yâge n’olûrhe, nâziba enjira yâge abule ihulukiro. <verse eid="HOS 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 2:9"/>Akulikîre abîra bâge, ci arhabahikekwo; abalonza arhacibabone. Buzi­nda aderhe, erhi: «Nkola nashubira emwa ibanie murhanzi, bulya nali mwinjà mîra kulusha buno.» <verse eid="HOS 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 2:10"/>Arhamanyaga yêhe oku nie nakâgimuhà engano, amamvu mahyâhya n’amavurha, nie namuhâga obuhirhi bw’amasholo n’ensaranga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ebyo byoshi byakagikolêsibwa omu kulonza okuhà Baali irenge.</char></note>, byo akagirhumikiramwo Baali!<verse eid="HOS 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 2:11"/>Co cirhumire, nkola nâshubiyanka engano yâni omu mango gâyo, n’amamvu gâni mahyâhya amango gâgo, nâmunyaga emishangi n’emipira yâni abwîsiremwo obushugunu bwâge. <verse eid="HOS 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 2:12"/>Na ntyo mmuyêrekane n’enshonyi zâge emwa abîra bâge, na ntâye wacimuntenza omu ikumi ly’eminwe. <verse eid="HOS 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 2:13"/>Nârhenza amasîma gâge goshi, ensiku nkulu zâge, emyêzi yâge mihya­hya, esabato zâge, n’emirimbo yâge yoshi. <verse eid="HOS 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 2:14"/>Nahererekeza enkoma zâge n’amalehe gâge akâgilimbira, mpu: «Balume bâni babimpâga.» Nâbijira bulambo ensimba zâkâyâbukiramwo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Olukoma n’amalehe: cimanyîso c’omurhûla n’obushagaluke kurhondêrera amango ga Salomoni (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 5:5">1 Bâm 5, 5</ref></char>).</char></note>. <verse eid="HOS 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 2:15"/>Nâmuhana oku nsiku za Baali, ezi akagimurherekêramwo, àkola ayambîrhe engolo n’amagerha. Niehe anyibagira! Kanwa ka Nyamuzinda.<verse eid="HOS 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HOS 2:16"/>Co cirhumire lêro nkola namurhebêba, mmuhêke omu irungu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amango gw’olubungo, oluhaga lwaheza obwôrhere bw’akalamo k’omw’irungu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="AMO 5:25">Amo 5, 25</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 12:10">Hoz 12, 10</ref></char>). Erhi Israheli aciri mwâna (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HOS 11:1-4">Hoz 11, 1-4</ref></char>) arhalimanyire banyamuzinda b’ihanga lya bene. Akagishimba Nyamuzinda wali omu citù (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HOS 2:16-17">Hoz 2, 16-17</ref>; <ref loc="JER 2:2-3">Yer 2, 2-3</ref></char>).</char></note>, <verse eid="HOS 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HOS 2:17"/>nshambâze omurhima gwâge. Kurhenga aho mmugalulire enkoma zâge n’olubanda lwa Akori, muhango gwa bulangâlire, ashuza lêro nk’amango aciri mugêngere n’amango arhengaga omu cihugo c’e Mîsiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2, 17: Lubanda lwa «Akori» luganjirwe omu mbanda zibà hôfi na Yeriko ziyêrekîre omu ndalâlà y’ecihugo, mwo bakagijirira ebijiro bigalugalu birhasîmîsa Nyamuzinda: <char style="xt"><ref loc="JOS 7:24-26">Yoz 7, 24-26</ref></char>. Izîno ly’olwo lubanda kwo kuderha: lubanda lwa buhanya (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JOS 7:26">Yoz 7, 26</ref></char>) lwâyishibà muhango gwa bulangâlire, bulya lwâhinduka njira ya kujà omu cihugo citagatîfu.</char></note>. <verse eid="HOS 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HOS 2:18"/>Olwo lusiku lêro, -kwo Nyakasane adesire-, wanderha, mpu: «Ibanie», orhacinderhe mpu «Baali wâni»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Baali: kwo kuderha «Nnawîrhu» ntyo kwo ba nyamuzinda b’e Kanâni bakagiderhwa. </char></note>. <verse eid="HOS 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HOS 2:19"/>Narhenza amazîno ga ba Baali omu kanwa kâge, barhakanaciderha ago mazîno bundi. <verse eid="HOS 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HOS 2:20"/>Olwo lusiku, nâjira kuli bo eciragâne haguma n’ensimba z’emuzirhu, e­nyunyi z’emalunga n’ebiyandala oku idaho; emiherho, engôrho, n’ebîrha, nâbivuna mbikage omu cihugo, nâmujira adêkerere n’omurhûla. <verse eid="HOS 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HOS 2:21"/>Nâkuyanka lwoshi ensiku zoshi, nâkuyanka omu bushinganyanya n’omu irhegeko, omu buzigire n’omu bwonjo. <verse eid="HOS 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HOS 2:22"/>Nâkuyanka omu bwemêzi, ntyo omanyîrire Nyamuzinda.<verse eid="HOS 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HOS 2:23"/>Mw’olwo lusiku, - kanwa ka Nyamuzinda, - nâshuza omu mpingu, nabo bashuze omu igulu. <verse eid="HOS 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HOS 2:24"/>lgulu lyâshuza omu kulêrha engano, amamvu mahyâhya n’amavurha, nabo bashuze e Yizreeli. <verse eid="HOS 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HOS 2:25"/>Nâmujira ishwa limîre omu cihugo, nâbabalira Bashombe, nabwîra Lurhali-Lubaga-Lwâni, nti: «We lubaga lwâni», naye anshuze, erhi: «Nyamuzinda wâni».<verse eid="HOS 2:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HOS 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Okushubîrira omukazi mubî, ihwe ly’obwonjo bwa Nyamuzinda wâni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 3:1"/>Nyamuzinda ashubimbwîra, erhi: «Genda kandi, ozigire omukazi ozigirwa n’ibà n’obwo eri mbaraga, nka kula niono Nyakasane nzigira bene Israheli n’obwo bàshizire abandibandi banyamuzinda, basîma n’ebitumbura by’emizâbîbu birherekêrwa abazimu ». <verse eid="HOS 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 3:2"/>Nanacigendirhôla mukânie obwo, nahûna mikabûlè ikumi n’irhanu ya nsaranga na nkuluba ndarhu za ngano<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hozeya agalula engulo Gomeri aliamagulwa emunda omulume wâge wa kabirhi ali. Eci­ twîro c’eyo ngulo ciyumanîne n’ecitwîro c’omujà (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 21:32">Lub 21, 32</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 27:4">Lev 27, 4</ref></char>).</char></note>. <verse eid="HOS 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 3:3"/>Nanamubwîra, nti: «Wabêra hano mwâni nsiku nyinji lêro, onaleke obu­shungu bwâwe. Ntà kuyinjibana wundi mulume, nâni nâjira ntyo emund’oli ».<verse eid="HOS 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 3:4"/>Kwo binali abantu b’Israheli bâyorha nsiku nyinji buzira mwâmi n’abarhambo, buzira nterekêro n’ibuye ly’emahêro, buzira ciru na efodi na terafimu. <verse eid="HOS 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 3:5"/>Buzinda bwenêne bashubigaluka emunda Nyakasane ali, bayêrekera emwa Nyamuzinda wâbo n’emw’obûko bwa Daudi mwâmi wâbo. Omu nsiku zâyisha balongereza n’obukenge obusù bwa Nyakasane n’ebinja Nyakasane abâna.<verse eid="HOS 3:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HOS 4"/>
  <para style="ms1">II Amaligo Israheli ajizire n’obuhane ayishirigahâbirwa</para>
  <para style="s1">Obubî bwabonekana hoshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 4:1"/>Muyumve akanwa ka Nyamuzinda, bene Israheli, bulya Nyamuzinda ali lubanja haguma n’abantu b’ecihugo. Omu cihugo, murhaciri mwîkubagirwa, ntà buzigire, ntà kucimanya na kukenga Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="HOS 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 4:2"/>Ci birha n’obunywesi, kunigana n’enshombo, bugonyi n’obulyâlya, kuyîrhana ene n’irhondo. <verse eid="HOS 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 4:3"/>Na ntyo ecihugo ciri omu mishîbo, n’abantu bamwo boshi bahosire, ciru n’ensimba z’emuzirhu n’enyunyi z’oku nkuba, ciru n’enfî z’omu nyanja ziherêrekîre. Obulyâlya bw’abadâhwa <verse eid="HOS 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 4:4"/>Ci kwône ntâye wajàga lubanja, ntâye wasambaga. We mudâhwa we nshimbire. <verse eid="HOS 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 4:5"/>Ohirimire mâshi, ohirimire budufu, n’omulêbi ahirimire haguma nâwe, na ntyo nkola nâyîrha nyoko. <verse eid="HOS 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 4:6"/>Olubaga lwâni lufirire okubula obumanye. Bulya w’oyo wakabulire obumanye, nkolaga nakukaga omu budâhwa bwâni; wayibagîre e­ nyigîrizo za Nyamuzinda wâwe nkolaga nayibagira abâna bâwe. <verse eid="HOS 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 4:7"/>Boshi oku banali banjirîre ebyâha, irenge lyâbo nâlihindula nshonyi. <verse eid="HOS 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 4:8"/>Ebyâha by’olubaga lwâni bwo bwigusi bwâbo, n’amabî gâlwo go bahà­rhira. <verse eid="HOS 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 4:9"/>Ci omudâhwa naye nâmujira kuguma n’olubaga; nâmuhanira olugendo lwâge, nâmulyuza ebijiro byâge. <verse eid="HOS 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 4:10"/>Bâlya, ci barhâyigurhe, bâjira obubaraga ci barhaburhe bâna; bulya balesire Nyakasane bacîhira omu by’enshonyi. Enterekêro ya Israheli eri nterekêro ya banyamuzinda bw’obwîhambi <verse eid="HOS 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 4:11"/>Obugonyi n’amamvu irhwe biheza. <verse eid="HOS 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 4:12"/>Olubaga lwâni lunagendilaguza emw’enshushano y’omurhi. Cihimbi ca karhi cilufulûlira emyanzi, bulya omurhima gw’obubaraga gwabahabwîre, balesire Nyamuzinda wâbo bashimba obubaraga. <verse eid="HOS 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 4:13"/>Oku busôngerwe bw’entondo kwo barherekêrera, oku rhurhondo kwo bayôkera entûlo zâbo, idako ly’emirhi y’emishebeye, emitudu, n’enterebinta, mpu ho hali ecîhôho. Co cirhumire, akabà bâli binyu ziri mbaraga, akabà bâlikazi binyu bali bagonyi, <verse eid="HOS 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 4:14"/>Ntâhane bâli binyu oku bubaraga bwâbo, ntâhane bâlikazi binyu oku bugonyi bwâbo, bulya nabo bônene eburhambi bacîyegiìlire n’e­mbaraga, barherekêre haguma n’entazi.<verse eid="HOS 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yûda na Israheli barhondwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 4:15"/>Akabà oli mbaraga, wâni Israheli, Yûda yêhe amanyage obubî. Mu­rhajâga e Gilgali, murhasôkeraga e Bet-Avena<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bet-Avena: nyumpa ya bubî: câha. Lir’izîno lya kugayaguza Beteli; n’obwo Beteli eri nyumpa ya Nyamuzinda.</char></note>, murhacigashaga, mpu: «mbotumirha Nyamuzinda». <verse eid="HOS 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HOS 4:16"/>Bulya Israheli aciyêrekîne nka cigamba, kurhi Nyamuzinda akacimuyâbulira nka mwâna-buzi omu bulambo bugali? <verse eid="HOS 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HOS 4:17"/>Efrayimu anywanîne n’abazimu, omuleke. <verse eid="HOS 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HOS 4:18"/>Ngasi hali endalwè ho balâla, barhishi n’oburhali bubaraga, abarhambo bâbo, enshonyi lyo irenge lyâbo. <verse eid="HOS 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HOS 4:19"/>Empûsi yabakurubukana omu byûbi byâyo, enshonyi zâbabumbira aha mpêro zâbo.<verse eid="HOS 4:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HOS 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Abadâhwa, abarhamho n’abâmi bo bahezize olubaga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 5:1"/>Muyumve, mwe badâhwa yumvirhizi wâni nyumpa y’Israheli, nyumpa ya mwâmi rhega okurhwiri, mwe balanzi b’amarhegeko; bulya mwabîre murhego aha Mispa, kêshe karhege oku Tabora. <verse eid="HOS 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 5:2"/>Bàyongobîre omu kuhabuka, niehe, nkolaga nabahana boshi. <verse eid="HOS 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 5:3"/>Nyîshi Efrayimu, na Israheli arhacinyifulisiri, nêci, Efrayimu wabîre mbaraga, nâwe Israheli wahemusire. <verse eid="HOS 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 5:4"/>Ebijiro byâbo birhankacibayêmêrera bagaluka emwa Nyamuzinda wâbo, bulya omurhima gw’obubaraga gubasêzize, barhaciyishi Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="HOS 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 5:5"/>Obucîbone bw’Israheli bumudwîrhe lubanja; amabî g’Efrayimu gamukulumbize na Yûda naye âhirima akàbo. <verse eid="HOS 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 5:6"/>Bahêka ebibuzi n’empanzi zâbo mpu bajilonza Nyamuzinda ci ba­rhâmubone: àbarhenzirekwo! <verse eid="HOS 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 5:7"/>Bàlenganyize Nyakasane, bàburha abâna b’omu ifunze. Olekage ensiku nkulu zâbo zibaherêrekeze bon’amashwa gâbo.<verse eid="HOS 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebîrha by’abaguma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 5:8"/>Mubûhe omushekera e Gilbeya, muhume omu ihembe e Rama, mubande endûlù e Bet-Avena, muhuluze Benyamini. <verse eid="HOS 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 5:9"/>Efrayimu ayônwa olusiku lw’obuhane, namâderha okunali oku mashanja g’Israheli. <verse eid="HOS 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 5:10"/>Abarhambo ba Yûda kwo bali nka bantu bahama olubibi, nkolaga nâbarhulirakwo obukunizi bwâni nka mîshi. <verse eid="HOS 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 5:11"/>Efrayimu ali mulabarhe, aluyazire, bulya akulikîre abazimu. <verse eid="HOS 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 5:12"/>Kwo nkola nayôrha kuli Efrayimu nka nnindi na nka mpêshe oku nyumpa ya Yûda.<verse eid="HOS 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okunywâna n’amahanga kuli busha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 5:13"/>Efrayimu erhi abona obubî bwâge, n’Israheli erhi abona ecibande câge, Efrayimu ajiyinjibana Asûru, Yûda arhuma, entumwa emw’omwâmi mukulu, ci kwône arhamufumye mweshi, arharhenze ecibande cinyu. <verse eid="HOS 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 5:14"/>Bulya nâbà ntale kuli Efrayimu, mwâna wa ntale oku nyumpa ya Yûda, niono, kudârhula nadârhula, nnancîgendere, mpêke n’omunyama gwâni, na ntâye wagunyaga. <verse eid="HOS 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 5:15"/>Nêci, nkolaga nâcishubirira aha mwâni, kuhika bamanye oku bali babî, banalonze obusù bwâni; bâcinnonza omu bulagîrire bwâbo.<verse eid="HOS 5:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HOS 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Okugalukira Nyamuzinda kurhajiraga nsiku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 6:1"/>Yishi rhugaluke emwa Nyamuzinda, Ye warhujaganulaga ye wânarhufumya; Ye wârhushûrhaga, ye wânarhuba ebibande bîrhu. <verse eid="HOS 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 6:2"/>Hano kugera nsiku ibirhi ârhugalulira obuzîne, oku lwa kasharhu ârhuyinamule rhunamubêreho. <verse eid="HOS 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 6:3"/>Rhumanyîrire Nyamuzinda, rhumulongereze, okuli rhwâmubona, âyisha emwîrhu nka lumè, nka kula enkuba mpangûka ebombêza idaho. <verse eid="HOS 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 6:4"/>Kurhi nakujira wâni Efrayimu? Kurhi nakujira wâni Yûda? Obuzigire bwinyu kwo buli nka citù ca lwikungu lwa sêzi, nka lumè lurhalegama. <verse eid="HOS 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 6:5"/>Co carhumire mbatwa bihimbi n’abalêbi, mbayîrha n’enderho z’ekanwa kâni; <verse eid="HOS 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 6:6"/>bulya buzigire nnonza, ci arhali nterekêro, bumanye bwa Nyamuzinda ci arhali ntûlo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lolà <char style="xt"><ref loc="HOS 2:21">2, 21</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 2:22">2, 22</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 5:21">Amo 5, 21</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 15:22">1 Sam 15, 22</ref></char>. <char style="xt"><ref loc="HOS 14:3">Hoz 14, 3</ref></char> adesire oku oburherekêre bushingânîne kuli kugaluka emwa Nnâmahanga.</char></note>.<verse eid="HOS 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Amabî ga mîra n’aga buno g’Israheli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 6:7"/>Ci bôhe bene Adamu bàvunyire eciragâne, aho bannenganya. <verse eid="HOS 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 6:8"/>Galaadi ciri cishagala ca bishumûsi, ciyunjwîre mukò. <verse eid="HOS 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 6:9"/>Kula ebishungu bicîfulika, omurhwe gw’abadâhwa gudwîrhe gwayîrha omu njira y’e Sikemi; okuli, olugendo lwâbo nshonyi nkulu. <verse eid="HOS 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 6:10"/>Ebi nabwîne e Beteli, birhankaderhwa: yo Efrayimu ajirira obubaraga, yo Israheli ahemukira. <verse eid="HOS 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 6:11"/>Ci kwône nâwe Yûda, nkubîkîre byâwe bitya, hano nshubiyimânika olubaga lwâni.<verse eid="HOS 6:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HOS 7"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 7:1"/>Oku ndwîrhe nti nafumya Israheli, amabî ga Efrayimu, gamaciyêrekana, n’obwengûza bwa Samâriya; bunywesi bwône bwône, ebishambo bidwîrhe byabera enyumpa, n’embuga elumîre bishungu. <verse eid="HOS 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 7:2"/>Barhacidesiri omu murhima gwâbo oku ncikengîre obubî bwâbo. Ci kwône ebijiro byâbo bibagosire, biri embere zâni. <verse eid="HOS 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 7:3"/>Bwenge bwâbo bashagalusamwo mwâmi, na bulyâlya bwâbo bashagalusamwo abarhambo. <verse eid="HOS 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 7:4"/>Ci kwône boshi bali bagonyi. Bali badûrhu nka masiga g’omuduzi w’emi­gati wagatwanîrc anagaleka kurhenga aduzire obuntu kuhika bwalinda burhundugurha. <verse eid="HOS 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 7:5"/>Badûndaguzize mwâmi n’abarhambo omu mamvu, naye yêne ayinjibana emihera, <verse eid="HOS 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 7:6"/>omu bulyâlya bwâbo, omurhima gwâbo guli mudûrhu nka cîko, obudufu bwoshi erhi obukunizi bwâbo buli îrò, sêzi buyâke nka ngulumira. <verse eid="HOS 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 7:7"/>Boshi badûrhubîre nka cibêye, balyîre babishi abatwî b’emmanja bâbo. Ntyo, abâmi bâbo boshi bahwîre, ntâye wanyakûzize.<verse eid="HOS 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Israheli afîre n’okunywâna n’amahanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 7:8"/>Efrayimu akomerîne n’amashanja g’ihanga, Efrayimu buli buntu bu­rhaniolagwa. <verse eid="HOS 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 7:9"/>Abanya-mahanga bàmulîre emisî arhanîshi. Irhwe lyâge lyasheshusire mvi, arhanakuyishi. <verse eid="HOS 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 7:10"/>Obucîbone bw’Israheli bumudwîrhe lubanja; barhanagalusiri emunda Nyakasane Nyamuzinda wâbo ali, ciru bakamulongereza kwo kunyi mw’ebyo byoshi. <verse eid="HOS 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 7:11"/>Efrayimu ngûkù mpwinja, erhagwêrhi irhwe; bahamagîre Mîsiri, bàjîre omu Asûru. <verse eid="HOS 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 7:12"/>Bagende, aha bankaja nâbarhega akêshe kâni, nâbamanula nka kanyunyi k’emalunga, nâbahana oku mabî gâbo.<verse eid="HOS 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okurhavuga omunkwa n’obuhane bw’Israheli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 7:13"/>Buhanya bwâbo bulya bànyâsire. Bahungumuke bulya banyabîre. Oku ndi nti nabacungula, badwîrhe bannywerhera. <verse eid="HOS 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 7:14"/>Barhalaka n’omurhima gwoshi emunda ndi, amango bayâmira aha ba­gweshîre; balakira engano n’amamvu mahyâhya gône, ci kuli nie, bwabiranyi bwône. <verse eid="HOS 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 7:15"/>Nabayigîrîze nanabahà amaboko mazibu, ci enkengêro zâbo nshombo kuli nie. <verse eid="HOS 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HOS 7:16"/>Bashizire obusha bayôsire nka muherho murhebanyi. Abarhambo bâbo bahwêra oku ngôrho, erhi lulimi lwâbo lubî lurhuma, babashekera omu cihugo c’e Mîsiri.<verse eid="HOS 7:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HOS 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Obiba empûsi, ayishisârûla omulaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 8:1"/>Bûha omushekera. Nka nyunda, obuhanya bwamacihunika oku nyumpa ya Nyamuzinda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Obuhanya bwamacihonda: 9, 15; ahâla, enyumpa ya Nyamuzinda karhali ka-Nyamuzinda ci cihugo c’amalaganyo.</char></note> w’Israheli, bulya bàvunyire eciragâne câni, banakabu­lira irhegeko lyâni. <verse eid="HOS 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 8:2"/>Ciru bakâyâma, mpu: «Mâshi Nyamuzinda w’Israheli, rhukumanyire.» <verse eid="HOS 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 8:3"/>Israheli àkabulire aminjà, lêro omushombanyi amuhâbwa.<verse eid="HOS 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ishâbâbè omu Samâriya n’okukaziharâmya akanina k’amasholo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 8:4"/>Bâcihîre abâmi, ci kwône buzira okundôsa. Banayîmike abarhambo, ci kwône buzira okummanyîsa. Banarhôle ensaranga zâbo n’amasholo, bajiremwo abazimu. Bwo bulyo bwinjà bw’okubaheza! <verse eid="HOS 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 8:5"/>Mwe bantu b’e Samâriya, aka kanina kinyu k’amasholo, ntakalonza, mwanzukize obukunizi. Bene Israheli, kuhika mangaci mwayôrhe buzira kutumula? <verse eid="HOS 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 8:6"/>N’obwo we Israheli! Nako akanina kâwe, mubumbi wakajiraga, karhali nyamuzinda. Okuli, akanina ka Samâriya kabunduka kajônjolekane. <verse eid="HOS 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 8:7"/>Kulya kubà mwarhwezire empûsi, mukolaga mwasârûla omusirûla: engano yinyu erhajekwo muhuli. Nk’oku omugani gudesire, mpu: «E­ngano buzira muhuli, erhajira nshâno». Na ciru gwankajakwo empara-mîno z’emahanga zo zâgulya.<verse eid="HOS 8:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HOS 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Olubaga lwa Nnâmahanga lukolaga lwâheza byoshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 9:1"/>Orhacîshingaga, Israheli, orhacîmogaga nka bapagani; bulya walesire nyamuzinda wâwe mpu oshimbe obubaraga, wasîmire oluhembo lw’a­ mabî omu ngo zoshi z’engano. <verse eid="HOS 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 9:2"/>N’oli engo, n’oli omukenzi birhabayiguse, amamvu mahyâhya ga babuli­kira. <verse eid="HOS 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 9:3"/>Barhacihêre omu cihogo ca Nyamuzinda, Efrayimu ashubira e Mîsiri, n’e Asîriya bâlyayo ebiryo by’okubahumânya. <verse eid="HOS 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 9:4"/>Barhâcidubule amamvu mpu barhûla Nyamuzinda, barhâcimuhe nterekêro, omugati gwâbo gwâbà nka mugati gwa mishîbo, ngasi ba­nkagulyakwo boshi bahumâne, bulya omugati gwâbo guli gwâbo bône­ne, gurhâhêkwe omu nyumpa ya Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="HOS 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 9:5"/>Kurhi mwâjira amango g’olusiku lukulu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Olusiku lukulu lurhakagerera omu lubungo bulya kukwânîne ociyêrekane embere za Nnâmahanga (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 23:16">Lub 23, 16</ref></char>).</char></note>, olusiku lukulu lwa Nyamuzinda? <verse eid="HOS 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 9:6"/>Bo abo bakola ebwa kuhêra: Mîsiri âbayankirira, Menfisi âbabishe, obuhirhi bwâbo bw’ensaranga, nshenga yabuyîmamwo, enyumpa zâbo zijamwo olûrhe. Okurhonda abadâhwa kwamâlerhera omulêbi nya­mmanja.<verse eid="HOS 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okumanyîsa oku buhane barheganyîbwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 9:7"/>Ensiku z’obuhane zayishire. Ensiku z’okucîhôla zino. Israheli ayumve! «Omulêbi ali musirhe!» Nêci nkaba bulya ecibî câwe ciri cinene, obuhane bwâluga, <verse eid="HOS 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 9:8"/>n’omu nyumpa ya Nyamuzinda wâge, yabîre ntambala. Omujà-bulâbi wa Efrayimu ali haguma na Nyamuzinda wâni, ye mulêbi, ye badwîrhe ba­rhega emirhambikiro omu njira zoshi n’omu nyumpa ya Nyamuzinda wâge. <verse eid="HOS 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 9:9"/>Babîhire lwoshi nk’omu nsiku za Gibeya; Nyamuzinda akengêra obubî bwâbo, âbahanira ebyâha byâbo.<verse eid="HOS 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obuhane oku mabî ga Baali-Peori</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 9:10"/>Kula amalehe gabà omu bwerûle, kwo nashimanaga Israheli; kula irehe lirhangiriza ly’ecanda liyôrha, kwo nabonaga basho; ci kwône bôhe bahika aha Baali-Peori, barhangira okukâjira eby’enshonyi, banahi­nduka bikabulirwa nk’enzigi yâbo. <verse eid="HOS 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 9:11"/>Irenge lya Efrayimu lyabalala nka kanyunyi: ntà kuciburha, ntà kucibà izîmi, ntà kuciyâlala. <verse eid="HOS 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 9:12"/>Ciru bakabà n’abâna, nâbahurhula embere bakûle; nêci buhanya bwâbo erhi nankabaleka. <verse eid="HOS 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 9:13"/>Efrayimu kwo namubonaga nka Tiri, murhwêre omu bulambo, cikwône abâna bâge abahêkera omubâzi. <verse eid="HOS 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 9:14"/>Akabà kukwânîne habè obuhane, Nyakasane, buhi bâhâbwa? Bakâbo obahindule ngumba, bayume amabêre.<verse eid="HOS 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obuhane oku mabî ga Gilgali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 9:15"/>Obubî bwâbo bwoshi bwabonekeraga aha Gilgali, ho nabashomberaga. Bijiro byâbo bibî byàrhumaga nabakûla omu nyumpa yâni, ntà buzigire ncigwêrhe kuli bo; abarhambo bâbo bâli bâbiryanyi. <verse eid="HOS 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HOS 9:16"/>Efrayimu ali oku idaho, emizî yâge myûmu, barhâciyânekwo malehe. Ciru bankaciburha abâna, nâyîrha irene ly’enda yâbo. <verse eid="HOS 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HOS 9:17"/>Nyamuzinda wâni abakabulira, bulya barhamuyumvagya, bâbà mihabuka ekarhî k’agandi mashanja.<verse eid="HOS 9:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HOS 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Okushâbwa kw’empêro z’abazimu b’Israheli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 10:1"/>Israheli lwàli lukoma lunagîrîre, lwakàgirhengamwo malehe manji. Oku amalehe gâge gal’iluzire, kwo aluzize n’empêro zâge. Oku ecihugo câge calihirhire, kwo ahirhizize n’amabuye gâge g’empêro. <verse eid="HOS 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 10:2"/>Abà bantu bali banywesi kuhika aha nsholo y’omurhima gwâbo. Ba­kolaga bâbarhula omuzigo gw’obubî bwâbo. Nyakasane âshâba e­mpêro zâbo, avungunyule n’amabuye gâbo g’empêro. <verse eid="HOS 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 10:3"/>Ago mango lyo baderha, mpu: «Rhurhajira mwâmi, bulya rhurharhînya Nyamuzinda; ci kwônene, omwâmi bici arhujirira?» <verse eid="HOS 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 10:4"/>Binwa oku binwa, cihango ca bunywesi, biragâne. Ci olubanja batwirîrwe lunagîrîre nka mburho mbî malingo g’amashwa. <verse eid="HOS 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 10:5"/>Bene Samâriya badwîrhe bageramwo omusisi oku kanina k’e Bet­ Avena; nêci, olubaga lwâko lwakajirire emishîbo. Obwo bakahêsire, karhacibaliko, bacîshingirageko, eryo irumbi mpu badâhwa! mîra bagûkiraga kulî nako. <verse eid="HOS 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 10:6"/>Nako kône kahêkwa e Asûru ntûlo oku mwâmi mukulu. Efrayimu âbona enshonyi, Israheli âgwarha ebusù oku muzimu wâge. <verse eid="HOS 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 10:7"/>Samâriya akunungusire. Omwâmi wâge hikola hyasi enyanya ly’amìîshi. <verse eid="HOS 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 10:8"/>Empêrero z’amabî zâshâbwa, câha c’Israheli: emishûgi n’enyûrhe zâmera oku mpêrero zâbo. Go mango bâkâbwîra entondo, mpu «Murhufunike», n’orhurhondo, mpu: «Murhuhirimirekw».<verse eid="HOS 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Israheli asârûle ehi arharhwêzire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 10:9"/>Kurhenga ensiku za Gibeya, wajizire ebyâha, Israheli. Barhalekaga. K’ebîrha, birhahike oku babî bali e Gibeya? <verse eid="HOS 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 10:10"/>Nkola nâj’ibahana, amashanja gâbalundûkirakwo, buhane bwa bîrya byâha byâbo bibirhi. <verse eid="HOS 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 10:11"/>Efrayimu yali ndaku etwîre bwinjà, yàsîma okuhama omu ngo; ci niehe, nkolaga nâyihira olukoba omu igosi, nâkanika Efrayimu, Yûda ajè âhinga, Yakôbo ajè âkulula enfuka. <verse eid="HOS 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 10:12"/>Murhwêre emburho y’obushinganyanya, musârûle emyâka y’obuzigire; muhinge amashwa mahyâhya: bulya gakola mango g’okulonza Nyakasane, kuhika ayishimmuyigîriza obushinganyanya. <verse eid="HOS 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 10:13"/>Ci kwône mwahinzire amabî, mwasârûlamwo obulyâlya, mwalya irehe ly’okurhebana. Bulya walangalîre ebiterusi byâwe, obunji bw’abà­lwî bâwe, <verse eid="HOS 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 10:14"/>entambala ekolaga yâzûka omu bishagala byâwe, emyûbako yâwe mizibu-zibu ekola yashâbwa; nka kulya Shalmani ashabaga Bet-Arbeli olusiku lw’ebîrha, amango omuzîre afîra oku bâna bâge. <verse eid="HOS 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 10:15"/>Ntyo kwo Beteli akukolîre oku bubî bwâwe burhakaderhwa; bwàli­ngicânûla, oleke wâbona oku bajira mwâmi w’Israheli.<verse eid="HOS 10:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HOS 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Nyamubâho alyûza abakengulaga obuzigire abayêrekaga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 11:1"/>Amango Israheli àciri kabonjo, namuzigira, nahamagala mugala wâni kurhenga e Mîsiri. <verse eid="HOS 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 11:2"/>Ci kwône oku nabahamagala bôhe bacinyegâlakwo; barherekîre ba Baali, banayôkera abazimu enterekêro. <verse eid="HOS 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 11:3"/>N’obwo niene nayigîrizagya Efrayimu okugenda, nakâmugwârhira oku kuboko, ci barhayumvagya oku kwàli kubalera. <verse eid="HOS 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 11:4"/>Nakàbarhogoza, nakàbashishiriza n’obuzigire; kuli bo kwo naliyôsire nka kula omulezi w’akabonjo akazikanûnugurha omu irhama, na­ kaziyûnamîra emunda ali namuhà ebi àlya. <verse eid="HOS 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 11:5"/>Barhâshubire omu cihugo c’e Mîsiri; Asûru ye wâbà mwâmi wâbo. Bulya bàlahlre okugaluka emunda ndi, <verse eid="HOS 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 11:6"/>engôrho yâzungula omu bishagala byâbo, yâherêrekeza, yâcîzanza omu nyumpa nzibuzibu, bubî bwâbo burhumire.<verse eid="HOS 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyamubâho abà wa lukogo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 11:7"/>Olubaga lwâni lwalwala obugoma; badwîrhe bashenga Baali, ci kwône arhabazùse. <verse eid="HOS 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 11:8"/>Efrayimu, kurhi nankakulcka, kurhi nakuhana, Israheli? Kurhi na­ nkakujira aka Adma, nkujire nka Seboyimu? Omurhima gwamampindamuka omu cifuba, obulà bwamànjuguma. <verse eid="HOS 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 11:9"/>Ntàciyuklriza obukunizi bwâni, lêro ntacishàbe Efrayimu, bulya ndi Nyamuzinda, ci ntali muntu ekarhl kawe, ndî yo Mwimâna, ntâyishe n’oburhè.<verse eid="HOS 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okurhenga e lubungo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 11:10"/>Abàlilulizîbwe bayishire bashimbire Nyakasane, naye àja àlumba nka ntale; nêci, àlumba, n’abâna bâge bayishe bashagamusire kurhenga ebuzikiro bw’izûba. <verse eid="HOS 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 11:11"/>Bârhenga e Mîsiri nka kanyuyi na nka ngûkù, omu cihugo c’Asûru, nâbadêkereza omu nyumpa zâbo obwo, kwo Nyakasane adesire.<verse eid="HOS 11:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HOS 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Olubaga lurhebanyi kurhenga aha canjo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 12:1"/>Efrayimu ampundikîre obunywesi, n’enyumpa y’Israheli oburhebanyi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Okuhundikira owundi obunywesi n’oburhebanyi; kwo kuli kumubwîkira olwibo e busù, kumurheba lwoshi lwoshi, anali asinza.</char></note>. Ci Yûda Nyamuzinda acimumanyire, kwo banamuderha mpu lubà­ga lwa Mwimâna. <verse eid="HOS 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 12:2"/>Efrayimu àyigusire empûsi, n’empûsi y’ebushoshôkero bw’izûba yo akulikîre; àyushwîre obunywesi n’obulyâlya: banywânîne bona Asîriya, badwîrhe bârhûla Mîsiri amavurha.<verse eid="HOS 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obuhane kuli Yakôbo na Efrayimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 12:3"/>Nyamuzinda ali lubanja bona Israheli, âjirira Yakôbo nk’oku n’obwôrhere bwâge bunali, âmugalulira nk’oku ebijiro byâge binali. <verse eid="HOS 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 12:4"/>Kurhenga omu nda ya nnina asigula mukulu wâge, erhi àbà musole, àlwîsa Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="HOS 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 12:5"/>Alwîsa Malahika anamuhima, àrhoza emirenge, àhûna obwonjo. Amushimânaga aha Beteli, n’aho ho Nyamuzinda àmuderhekezagya. <verse eid="HOS 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 12:6"/>Nêci, Nyamubâho Nyamuzinda w’Emirhwe, Nyamubâho lyo izîno lyâge. <verse eid="HOS 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 12:7"/>Wêhe, galuka emwa Nyamuzinda wâwe, langa obuzigire n’obushinga­ nyanya, onalangâlire Nyamuzinda wâwe ensiku zoshi.<verse eid="HOS 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obuhubu n’obuhane bw’Israheli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 12:8"/>Kanâni afumbîrhe eminzâni y’oburhebanyi, asîma okuyungunganya. <verse eid="HOS 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 12:9"/>Efrayimu àdesire, erhi: «Nêci, nkola mugale, nalundisire obuhirhi.» Ci kwône ntâco câmusigalira kuli ebyo byoshi, bulya àjizire amabî.<verse eid="HOS 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okulangâlira okubabalirwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 12:10"/>Nie Nyamubâho, Nyamuzinda wâwe, kurhenga omu cihugo c’e Mîsiri. Nakuhândìsa kandi omu mahêma, nk’omu lusiku lw’okushimânana. <verse eid="HOS 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 12:11"/>Nabwira abalêbi, nayûshûla amalêbi, n’abalêbi bo bâderhamwo emi­gâni.<verse eid="HOS 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kandi Nyamubâho ashubibà burhè</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 12:12"/>Galadi bwabire bubî bwône nabo, bali banywesi; e Gilgali bakazi­rherekêra empanzi; co cirhumire empêro zâbo zâbà nka nnundo ya mabuye omu ishwa. <verse eid="HOS 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 12:13"/>Yakôbo ayâkira omu ishwa ly’Aramu, Israheli âjishigira omukazi, akaziyâbula amasò mpu lyo abona omukazi. <verse eid="HOS 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 12:14"/>Ci kwône, oku kanwa k’omulêbi, Nyamuzinda âyinamula Israheli e Mîsiri, âlangwa n’omulêbi. <verse eid="HOS 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 12:15"/>Efrayimu akuniza bwenêne Nyamuzinda, Nyakasane wâge âmubarhuza omukò gwabulajisire. Nnawâbo âmugalulira ebijâci byâge.<verse eid="HOS 12:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HOS 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Obuhane bw’okuharâmya abazimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 13:1"/>Erhi Efrayimu àderhaga akanwa, kàli ka kuyôbohwa, àli mukulu omu Israheli, ci kwône àjira amabî haguma na Baali, kwabà kufà. <verse eid="HOS 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 13:2"/>Na buno kandi byâha balimwo, badwîrhe bàbumba ensalamu omu nsaranga zâbo, bo bazimu b’obukengêre bwâbo; mukolo gwa babumbi ebyo byoshi. Erhi bànaderha, mpu: «Mubarherekêre.» Abantu badwîrhe bàjikânunugurha orhunina. <verse eid="HOS 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 13:3"/>Co carhuma bâbà nka lwikungu lwa sêzi, nka lumè lurhimangikala, nka hyasi hiyehûkanwa n’empûsi omu ngo, nka mugî gwahuluka omu kabonezo.<verse eid="HOS 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obuhane bw’okurhavuga omunkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 13:4"/>N’obwo nie Nyakasane, Nyamuzinda wâwe, kurhenga omu cihugo c’e Mîsiri, orhîshi wundi Nyamuzinda kuleka nie, na kuleka nie, ntà wundi Muciza. <verse eid="HOS 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 13:5"/>Nakulîsize omu irungu, n’obwo cihugo ca bwerûle. <verse eid="HOS 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 13:6"/>Nabahîre aha bakerera, banayigurha; erhi bàbà bamâyigurha, omurhima gwâbo gwacîbona lêro nayibagira. <verse eid="HOS 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 13:7"/>Co cirhumire nyôrha nka ntale kuli bo, nka ngwî oku burhambi bw’e­njira, nakâlingûza: <verse eid="HOS 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 13:8"/>Nâcihunika liguma kuli bo nka mpunga onyazirwe abâna, nâbashenyula ensholo y’omurhima, aho nâbashayagula nka ntale nkazi; e­nsimba z’emuzirhu z’abatwa bihimbi.<verse eid="HOS 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuyûrha kw’obwâmi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 13:9"/>Israheli, k’orhacishabûka obu? Kàli nie burhabâle bwâwe. <verse eid="HOS 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 13:10"/>Ngahigi omwâmi wâwe ali, akurhabâle? Abarhambo b’emwâwe bâkufungire? Balya wakâgiderha, mpu: «Mpà-nâni omwâmi n’abarhambo.» <verse eid="HOS 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 13:11"/>Omwârni nakuhîreye omu burhè, n’omu burhè nkunyazire ye.<verse eid="HOS 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuherêrekera kwa Efrayimu kwo kunahali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 13:12"/>Obubî bwa Efrayimu buli bugobeke, ecâha câge ciri cibikirîrwe bwinjà. <verse eid="HOS 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 13:13"/>Emikero y’izîmi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Emikero y’izîmi eyêrekîne obuhanya burhezire olubaga (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 6:24">Yer 6, 24</ref>; <ref loc="JER 22:23">22, 23</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 26:17">Iz 26, 17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 66:6-7">66, 6-7</ref></char>). Buhanya Nyamuzinda abarhumîre lyo bahinduka omurhima: na ntyo barhondêre akalamo kahyâhya.</char></note> emuzûkîre ci omwâna ciri cinganyi; akola ahisize emyêzi, ci arhârhenga omu nda ya nnina. <verse eid="HOS 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 13:14"/>Ka nâbarhenza ekuzimu? Ka nâbaciza oku lufù? Lufù we, ngahi cihûsi wâwe ali? Nn’ekuzimu we, ngahi ibala lyâwe liri? Olukogo Lu­mpwîre ebusù. <verse eid="HOS 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 13:15"/>Ciru Efrayimu ankagandâza ekarhî ka bene wâbo, empûsi ya Nyamuzinda yâyinamuka omu irungu, yâganya enshôko zâge, yâyûmya amaliba gâge, yâherêrekeza ecihugo câge n’ebinja byâco byo­shi.<verse eid="HOS 13:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="HOS 14"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 14:1"/>Samâriya àhanwa, bulya àjizire obwabiranyi kuli Nyamuzinda wâge. Bakumba omu ngôrho, orhubonjo rhwâbo rhwâhinagwa, bakâbo bali mazîmi bâbwagûka enda.<verse eid="HOS 14:1"/></para>
  <para style="ms1">III. Okugaluka n’okushubirhona kwa Israheli</para>
  <para style="s1">Israheli agaluka omu bwîra bwa Nyamuzinda</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 14:2"/>Galuka, Israheli, emwa Nyamubâho, Nyamuzinda wâwe, bulya bubî bwâwe bwakusârhazagya.<verse eid="HOS 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 14:3"/>Ocîyikire ebinwa, oshubire emwa Nyamuzinda. Omubwîre, erhi: «Orhenzagye ngasi hibî, orhôle ngasi hinjà, àhâli h’empanzi, rhwakurhûla akanwa kîrhu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Binwa bya kuhûna obwonjo, ci birhali bya kurhûla enterekêro: <char style="xt"><ref loc="HOS 6:6">6, 6</ref></char>.</char></note>».<verse eid="HOS 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 14:4"/>Asûru ârharhucize, rhurhâcishone oku biterusi, rhurhakanaciderha nti Nyamuzinda wîrhu, obushanja bw’amaboko gîrhu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Okukabulira enshusho babinjaga n’amaboko gâbo kuli kuyêrekana oku obulangâlire bwaho burhaciri oku misî ya Asûru n’omu marhwâli g’abasirika n’ebiterusi byalikola biri ahâli ha Nyamuzinda Mucunguzi wâbo: <char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 30:1-5">Iz 30, 1-5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 31:1-3">31, 1-3</ref></char>.</char></note>, bulya emwâwe yo enfûzi ebona olukogo.<verse eid="HOS 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 14:5"/>Nâfumya obugoma bwâbo nâshubibazigira n’omurhima gwoshi; bulya obukunizi bwâni bwahwîre kuli bo. <verse eid="HOS 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 14:6"/>Nâbà nka lumè kuli Israheli, âkulirira nka bwâso bwa liliya, âliha emizî nka mirhi ya nshebeyi y’e Libano.<verse eid="HOS 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 14:7"/>Orhummerêra rhwâge rhwâgandâza, âbà mwinjà nka mugavu gw’e Libano.<verse eid="HOS 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 14:8"/>Bâgaluka babwarhale aha cîhôho câni, bâyêza engano yâbo, bâgwîka olukoma, lwarhengamwo amamvu minjà nka g’e Libano.<verse eid="HOS 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 14:9"/>Efrayimu, lushangi luci ociri mwe n’abazimu? Ndwîrhe nâmuyumvi­rhiza nânamulola. Kwo ndi nka nshebeyi enagîrîre, nie ntumire wâyêrakwo amalehe.<verse eid="HOS 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Akarhonde karhafà oku bulembo</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 14:10"/>Indi mwîrhonzi ayumve ebyo binwa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:10">Wa bukengêre, abîhîre omu marhwiri?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:10">Enjira za Nyamuzinda zibà nnungêdu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:10">Abashinganyanya banazigeremwo bwinjà,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:10">ci abanyabyâha kusârhala bazisârhalamwo.<verse eid="HOS 14:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 14"/>
</usx>
